        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Cost</strong> nothing · <strong>Requirements</strong> You are in <strong>Severance</strong></p><hr /><p>Every misfortune you have held back for other people, handed to one person at once.</p><p><strong>One creature within 60 feet</strong>, basic Fortitude, <strong>spirit</strong> damage.</p><p>This <strong>ignores all resistances and immunities</strong>. The target is <strong>doomed 1</strong>. If you have used your Release Technique at least three times this encounter, it is <strong>doomed 2</strong> instead.</p><hr /><p><strong>&#9888; Extrapolated</strong> &mdash; the redistribution of fortune is Haschwalth's canon Schrift.</p><hr /><p><strong>Waning.</strong> The damage is <strong>20d6</strong> if used in the first round of Severance, and two dice fewer each round after &mdash; 18d6, 16d6, 14d6, 12d6, 10d6, and <strong>8d6</strong> in the seventh. After the seventh round this cannot be used at all.</p><p><strong>Using this ends Severance</strong>, whether you want it to or not.</p>"
